Close the defsetf lambda list's parenthesis (concept-bvl.tex).
The syntax rule at concept-bvl.tex:1181-1187 opens a parenthesis with
\lparen and never closes it: its last line, the &environment option, lacks
the \rparen the rules at :97, :482, :550 and :598 end with.  Add it.
--- concept-bvl.tex
+++ concept-bvl.tex
@@ -1184,7 +1184,7 @@
 		     \xparen\f{[}\Vtop{\hbox{{\key} \star{\KeyVarValueSuppliedP}}
 				  \vskip 4pt
 				  \hbox{\brac{\allowotherkeys}\f{]}}}\CR
-		     \xparen\ttbrac{{\environment} \param{var}}}
+		     \xparen\ttbrac{{\environment} \param{var}}\rparen}
 
 A \term{defsetf lambda list} can contain the \term{lambda list keywords} shown
 in \thenextfigure.
